# Overview and index maintenance

## Mandatory synchronization

When a component/foundation page is created, deleted, or renamed, update its overview page in the same change.

## Components

- Source pages: `docs/components/*.md` (excluding `overview.md`)
- Index page: `docs/components/overview.md`
- Keep the component list alphabetically sorted by display name.
- Ensure links point to existing files.

## Foundations

- Source pages: `docs/foundations/*.md` (excluding `overview.md`)
- Index page: `docs/foundations/overview.md`
- Keep link lists updated and remove stale entries.

## Consistency checks

- No orphan docs (page exists but not listed in overview).
- No dead links in overview pages.
- One entry per page (no duplicates).
